# L §8.3 LOAD-CYCLE `<x> depends on itself at the same key: <path>`, and "each refusal names its file, line and item"
# (tally 2.1.6, P31 on T's SR-T3 of #71): at the line of x's def, as a beats cycle prints at its def's. refcore 2.1.5
# and 2.1.6's first (522a715) printed no place.
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-02
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-01-05

source s "s"

input x: int

def a: int = b + x at reader

def b: int = a at reader

ask q: x

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  x = 1
=== expect
refused: LOAD-CYCLE a depends on itself at the same key: a -> b -> a (m.tally:11)
